  "description": "<p>The task here is to implement support for the WANT-DIGEST header specified in the API.</p>\n\n<p>API Reference: <a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr</a></p>\n\n<p>When complete the following failing API Test Suite Tests should succeed.</p>\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-A-1</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for supported digest: md5 . GET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-A-2</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for supported digest: sha . GET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-A-3</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for supported digest: sha-256 . GET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-B</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for two supported digests with no weights GET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-C</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for two supported digests with different weightsGET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-D</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for two supported digests with different weights q=0.3,q=0 GET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-get-ldpnr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">3.2.3-E</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'> </td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Testing for one supported digest and one unsupported digest.GET requests to any LDP-NR must correctly respond to the Want-Digest header defined in <span class=\"error\">&#91;RFC3230&#93;</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n",
